sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Tailnet User
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Voice as Pi Voice Service
    participant Edge as Voice Edge
    participant Gateway as Agent Gateway
    participant Store as S3 Workspace / Result Store
    participant Queue as PostgreSQL / Absurd
    participant Worker as Pi Task Worker
    participant Gitea as Gitea Actions and Packages
    participant Builder as Shared Gondolin Builder
    participant Model as Model Provider
    participant Tools as Gondolin / Wassette

    alt Browser task panel
        User->>Browser: Submit or approve durable work
        Browser->>Edge: Send owner-scoped lifecycle action
        Edge->>Gateway: Forward lifecycle action with gateway capability
    else Pi voice tool
        User->>Voice: Ask Pi to delegate durable work
        Voice->>Gateway: Propose or directly submit with owner identity
    end
    Gateway->>Store: Resolve allowlisted immutable Git bundle
    Store-->>Gateway: Content-addressed workspace URI
    Gateway->>Queue: Persist proposal and enqueue only approved work
    Worker->>Queue: Claim one task
    Worker->>Store: Download and verify workspace bundle
    Store-->>Worker: Immutable Git bundle
    opt Repository declares an uncached .pi/gondolin.json build
        Worker->>Gitea: Dispatch repository workflow and checkpoint run ID
        Gitea->>Builder: Assign job to capacity-one runner
        Builder->>Gitea: Check out immutable revision
        Builder->>Host API: Stream context and poll image-build job
        Host API->>Host Docker: Build image through Docker Engine API
        Host Docker->>Handoff: Save versioned image tar
        Worker->>Gitea: Observe terminal workflow status
        Worker->>Handoff: Read local image tar
        Worker->>Worker: Import tar and register image ref
    end
    Worker->>Model: Run stateless Pi task-agent loop
    Worker->>Tools: Execute isolated workspace or integration tools
    Tools-->>Worker: Bounded tool result
    Model-->>Worker: Final spoken and Mermaid response
    Worker->>Store: Upload bounded patch, status, and execution result
    Worker->>Queue: Checkpoint terminal result
    User->>Browser: Refresh status or request result
    Browser->>Edge: Read task state
    Edge->>Gateway: Get owner-filtered result
    Gateway->>Queue: Fetch task snapshot
    Queue-->>Gateway: State and bounded result
    Gateway-->>Edge: Public task view
    Edge-->>Browser: Result, Mermaid, and optional speech
    Browser-->>User: Show or speak result
